          "textRaw": "[m] transaction",
          "name": "[m]_transaction",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "transaction(transactionCallback, exclusive?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "transaction",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**transactionCallback** { [function](dataTypes#function) } ",
                      "name": "**transactionCallback**",
                      "type": " [function](dataTypes#function) "
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ exclusive = `true` ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "exclusive = `true` ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) }"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [EventEmitter](eventEmitterType) } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [EventEmitter](eventEmitterType) "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "transactionCallback"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "exclusive?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>同步执行事务并返回事件发射器. <code>transactionCallback</code> 会收到 <code>Transaction</code> 对象; 正常执行后内部调用 <code>transaction.succeed()</code>, 最终调用 <code>transaction.end()</code>.</p>\n<p>事务事件:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>begin</code> - 事务开始</li>\n<li><code>commit</code> - 事务成功提交</li>\n<li><code>rollback</code> - 事务回滚</li>\n<li><code>end</code> - 事务结束</li>\n<li><code>error</code> - 回调抛出异常时触发</li>\n</ul>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] transaction"
        },
